      ProxyKit for FAR manager
   Far Navigator (ProxyFtp) plugin
          version 1.9.b4

This module is designed as an extension
to FAR and intended for performing the
various operations with files and
directories on FTP and HTTP servers.

 - Browse HTTP servers
 - Browse FTP servers
 - Work with FTP/HTTP/SOCKS proxies
 - "Server To Server" transfer mode
 - Resume function
 - Custom connection parameters
   (Idle timeout, retry count, ...)
 - FAR language tables support
 - Sources files included
 - And more...

Send all wishes to proxykit@newmail.ru
